+## Give a number its own booking time zone
+
+Use the web dashboard for this task, including in your phone’s browser.
+
+In **Integrations**, select the business number, open **Cal.com**, and find **Booking time zone**. Choose the city that follows your branch’s local clocks and select **Save time zone**. Reopen the card to check the zone and where it came from. Owners and Admins can save a change. Members can view it.
+
+Choose **Use agent time zone** to clear the number’s choice. Nixflex then uses the agent’s zone, the saved Cal.com connection’s zone, or London, in that order. This setting changes Cal.com appointment times only. Two numbers can share an agent and a calendar and still book in different local times.
+
+If an existing appointment changes while a caller is moving or cancelling it, the agent reads the updated appointment back. Let it finish, then confirm the specific appointment. An earlier yes cannot approve the changed time. Check the actual calendar for the result.
+
