+## Read the Cal.com booking zone
+
+`calcom_timezone_override` is the number’s saved IANA zone or null. When booking is available, `effective_calcom_timezone` is the resolved zone and `effective_calcom_timezone_source` is `number`, `agent`, `connection` or `default`, in that order. The final fallback is `Europe/London`. A number without a booking context can have a saved override and omit both effective fields. General call time and Google Calendar settings are independent.
+
+Read the number owned by the authenticated account. Use its saved and effective values to confirm a previous update.
+
+```bash
+curl -X GET "https://api.nixflex.com/v1/phone-numbers/%2B12025550100" \
+  -H "Authorization: Bearer $NIXFLEX_API_KEY"
+```
+
+Example number response (relevant fields):
+
+```json
+{
+  "phone_number": {
+    "phone_number": "+12025550100",
+    "calcom_timezone_override": "America/New_York",
+    "effective_calcom_timezone": "America/New_York",
+    "effective_calcom_timezone_source": "number"
+  }
+}
+```
